    "name": "Starless Umbra",
    "steam_appid": 3101780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/2fb8709afaf09343119f36798af6ebf8.poster.avif?t=1755356275\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/2fb8709afaf09343119f36798af6ebf8.apng?t=1755356275\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Story Header\" width=616 height=56 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starless Umbra is a character-driven, couch co-op action RPG about discovery, the moral ambiguity of loyalty, and confronting the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Alcuria is enveloped by a noxious, seasonal fog known as the Umbra. You play as Amalia, a tracker from the colony of Tulron protected from these dangers, until your best friend is kidnapped. But as the search twists deeper into the unknown, what begins as a simple rescue mission unravels into something far greater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ae2a39e18b30c35c4a30aba9a9607eaa.poster.avif?t=1755356275\" aria-label=\"Clip of two characters fighting against snakes\" width=400 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ae2a39e18b30c35c4a30aba9a9607eaa.webm?t=1755356275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ae2a39e18b30c35c4a30aba9a9607eaa.mp4?t=1755356275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/80de2dd7e44b460f7e8e2033d5ab141f.poster.avif?t=1755356275\" aria-label=\"Features Header\" width=616 height=56 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/80de2dd7e44b460f7e8e2033d5ab141f.webm?t=1755356275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-time Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start battles as you approach enemies on the field</strong>. No map transitions, no turns, just real-time combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from a variety of cooldown-based\u00a0skills</strong>; there's no &quot;magic points&quot; to worry about replenishing. HP replenishes after battle as well, provided your party is in good spirits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate enemy focus (aggro)</strong>, encourage your teammates, and master skill rotations in a battle system reminiscent of classic MMORPG combat and modern action RPGs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with either intelligent computer-controlled characters or  friends</strong> (couch co-op) for even more chaos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plenty of character customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select your character's abilities</strong> to bring into battle, customizing them with augments: discoverable gems that adjust the characteristics of skills. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn passive abilities</strong> from the equipment your characters use. These abilities may give buffs at the start of combat, give you a boost of strength while your allies are down, or\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine skills</strong> to build your own devastating combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/3060cbc90bad05bd2bdc954dc5175572.poster.avif?t=1755356275\" aria-label=\"Clip of a character traveling to a mansion in the snow\" width=400 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/3060cbc90bad05bd2bdc954dc5175572.webm?t=1755356275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/3060cbc90bad05bd2bdc954dc5175572.mp4?t=1755356275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A focus on fun</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a 15-25 hour main story</strong> that focuses on interpersonal relationships and the world they've been born into.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy gameplay variety</strong>: minigames, puzzles, quests to complete. Your decisions and performance affect the game's difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encouraged item usage</strong> over hoarding. Potions may be replenished by refilling empty bottles in towns.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ca785acff4e7107ad322d879cff6938e.poster.avif?t=1755356275\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ca785acff4e7107ad322d879cff6938e.apng?t=1755356275\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Team Header\" width=616 height=56 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is the product of slow, deliberate development effort over a span of 20 years, multiple engine attempts, story do-overs, and an encouraging (and patient) community.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>zexyu</strong> - Story, engineering, some graphics (tilesets, characters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>sako</strong> - Character portraits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>puking</strong> <strong>rabbit</strong> - Monster sprites</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/2fb8709afaf09343119f36798af6ebf8.poster.avif?t=1755356275\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/2fb8709afaf09343119f36798af6ebf8.apng?t=1755356275\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Story Header\" width=616 height=56 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starless Umbra is a character-driven, couch co-op action RPG about discovery, the moral ambiguity of loyalty, and confronting the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Alcuria is enveloped by a noxious, seasonal fog known as the Umbra. You play as Amalia, a tracker from the colony of Tulron protected from these dangers, until your best friend is kidnapped. But as the search twists deeper into the unknown, what begins as a simple rescue mission unravels into something far greater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ae2a39e18b30c35c4a30aba9a9607eaa.poster.avif?t=1755356275\" aria-label=\"Clip of two characters fighting against snakes\" width=400 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ae2a39e18b30c35c4a30aba9a9607eaa.webm?t=1755356275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ae2a39e18b30c35c4a30aba9a9607eaa.mp4?t=1755356275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/80de2dd7e44b460f