ras/3060cbc90bad05bd2bdc954dc5175572.poster.avif?t=1755356275\" aria-label=\"Clip of a character traveling to a mansion in the snow\" width=400 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/3060cbc90bad05bd2bdc954dc5175572.webm?t=1755356275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/3060cbc90bad05bd2bdc954dc5175572.mp4?t=1755356275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A focus on fun</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a 15-25 hour main story</strong> that focuses on interpersonal relationships and the world they've been born into.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy gameplay variety</strong>: minigames, puzzles, quests to complete. Your decisions and performance affect the game's difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encouraged item usage</strong> over hoarding. Potions may be replenished by refilling empty bottles in towns.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ca785acff4e7107ad322d879cff6938e.poster.avif?t=1755356275\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ca785acff4e7107ad322d879cff6938e.apng?t=1755356275\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Team Header\" width=616 height=56 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is the product of slow, deliberate development effort over a span of 20 years, multiple engine attempts, story do-overs, and an encouraging (and patient) community.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>zexyu</strong> - Story, engineering, some graphics (tilesets, characters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>sako</strong> - Character portraits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>puking</strong> <strong>rabbit</strong> - Monster sprites</p></li></ul>",
